---
title: "new_generator (Sui Framework: random)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_load_inner: inner = r.load_inner()
    q_load_inner --> q_derive_seed: seed = hmac_sha3_256(inner.random_bytes, ctx.fresh_object_address)
    q_derive_seed --> [*]: return RandomGenerator(seed, counter=0, buffer=empty)

    note right of q_derive_seed
        INV-001: seed derived from global randomness + fresh address (unique per call)
        INV-002: generator can produce up to U16_MAX * 32 random bytes
        INV-003: HMAC-SHA3-256 ensures cryptographic separation between generators
        INV-004: fresh_object_address provides transaction-level uniqueness
    end note
